WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
There would be no nothing.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.920
Just a few years ago, reckless experiments overseas

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.800
gave us a devastating global pandemic.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.040
Yet, despite that worldwide catastrophe,

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.200
many countries are continuing extremely risky research

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.799
into bioweapons and man-made pathogens.

